{"ref":"BDB, מִמְכָּר","hw":"מִמְכָּר","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">מִמְכָּר</span></big>  <strong>n.m.</strong> <sup><a data-ref=\"Leviticus 25:28\" href=\"/Leviticus.25.28\">Lv 25:28</a></sup> <strong>sale, ware</strong>;—abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">מ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 25:14\" href=\"/Leviticus.25.14\">Lv 25:14</a> + 2 times; cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">מִמְכַּר</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 25:25\" href=\"/Leviticus.25.25\">Lv 25:25</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 25:33\" href=\"/Leviticus.25.33\">33</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">מִמְכָּרוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 25:27\" href=\"/Leviticus.25.27\">Lv 25:27</a> + 3 times; pl. sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">מִמְכָּרָיו</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 18:8\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.18.8\">Dt 18:8</a> (but v. sub <a data-ref=\"BDB, מֶ֫כֶר\" href=\"/BDB,_מֶ֫כֶר\", dir=\"rtl\">מֶכֶר</a>);—<em>sale</em> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 25:27\" href=\"/Leviticus.25.27\">Lv 25:27</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 25:29\" href=\"/Leviticus.25.29\">29</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 25:50\" href=\"/Leviticus.25.50\">50</a>; <em>thing sold</em> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 25:14\" href=\"/Leviticus.25.14\">Lv 25:14</a> (acc. cogn.), v <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 25:25\" href=\"/Leviticus.25.25\">25</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 25:28\" href=\"/Leviticus.25.28\">28</a> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 7:13\" href=\"/Ezekiel.7.13\">Ez 7:13</a> <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 13:20\" href=\"/Nehemiah.13.20\">Ne 13:20</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">מִמְכַּר בַּיִת</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 25:33\" href=\"/Leviticus.25.33\">Lv 25:33</a> (Hex. only PH). On <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 18:8\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.18.8\">Dt 18:8</a> v. <a data-ref=\"BDB, מֶ֫כֶר\" href=\"/BDB,_מֶ֫כֶר\", dir=\"rtl\">מֶכֶר</a>.","next":"BDB, מִמְכֶּ֫רֶת","prev":"BDB, מִכְרִי"}